Description: Read Lora.Socket from config.yaml into quadrf_socket, and
 extend the existing "sim has no SPI device" early-return to also cover
 use_quadrf, so a soft radio backed by an out-of-process transport never
 touches lora_spi_dev / DIO2 / DIO3 config meant for real chips.
Author: Roy C. Gross <61633595+radioroy@users.noreply.github.com>
Origin: other
Forwarded: no
